@page "/lab"
@model LabModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Lab setup";
}

<div class="demo-head">
    <div class="eyebrow">Lab setup</div>
    <h1>Make the server match the talk</h1>
    <p class="lede">
        The demos depend on a few server settings: compatibility level 170, Query Store capturing everything,
        last actual plans, and an Extended Events session. Each check below says how to fix it. The buttons run
        the numbered scripts in the repo's <code>scripts</code> folder, so what the app does is exactly what you'd run by hand.
    </p>
</div>

<div hx-get="/lab?handler=Environment" hx-trigger="load, lab-changed from:body">
    <p class="muted">Checking the database (gives up after 20 seconds)...</p>
</div>

<div class="card action" style="margin-top:1rem">
    <form hx-post="/lab?handler=Doctor" hx-target="#doctor-result" hx-indicator="find .spinner" hx-disabled-elt="find button">
        <h3>Connection check</h3>
        <p>If anything spins forever, start here. It walks the connection one step at a time (name lookup, TCP port, TLS and login, database, permissions), each with its own short time limit, and tries <code>Encrypt=False</code> and <code>127.0.0.1</code> as alternatives so you can see which one works. The password is never shown, only its length.</p>
        <div class="go"><button class="btn">Run connection check</button><span class="spinner"></span></div>
    </form>
    <div id="doctor-result" style="margin-top:0.8rem"></div>
</div>

<h2 style="margin-top:2rem">Actions</h2>
@if (!Model.AdminAllowed)
{
    <p class="admin-note">@Model.AdminReason</p>
}
<div class="admin-grid">
    <div class="card action">
        <form hx-post="/lab?handler=Setup" hx-target="#admin-result" hx-indicator="find .spinner" hx-disabled-elt="find button">
            <h3>Setup</h3>
            <p>Runs <code>01-setup-database.sql</code> and <code>03-xe-session.sql</code>. Safe to run again.</p>
            <div class="go"><button class="btn" @(Model.AdminAllowed ? "" : "disabled")>Run setup</button><span class="spinner"></span></div>
        </form>
    </div>
    <div class="card action">
        <form hx-post="/lab?handler=Reset" hx-target="#admin-result" hx-indicator="find .spinner" hx-disabled-elt="find button">
            <h3>Reset between demos</h3>
            <p>Runs <code>05-reset-between-demos.sql</code>: clears the plan cache and Query Store, restarts the XE session. Laptop only.</p>
            <div class="go"><button class="btn" @(Model.AdminAllowed ? "" : "disabled")>Reset</button><span class="spinner"></span></div>
        </form>
    </div>
    <div class="card action">
        <form hx-post="/lab?handler=Inflate" hx-target="#admin-result" hx-indicator="find .spinner" hx-disabled-elt="find button">
            <h3>Build the Hits table (optional)</h3>
            <p>Runs <code>06-inflate-for-psp.sql</code>: one row per hit, several million rows. Gives demo 1 enough skew for PSP to kick in. Takes a minute.</p>
            <div class="go"><button class="btn" @(Model.AdminAllowed ? "" : "disabled")>Build Hits</button><span class="spinner"></span></div>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>
<div id="admin-result" style="margin-top:1rem"></div>
